rooms_desc ({"To the north you can see the entrance to the house.The walls of the house gleam in a strange dark color.To the south you can see a garden, and to the east and west you see a seaof roses. (Dont try to enter, the thorns look very poisonous)The sky above also seems to have the same strange gleam, that you cannotsee, where the house ends, and the sky beginns.The floor under your feet is made out of a dark looking stone and you seecomfortable chairs standing around. In the middle is a great table.","The Entrance-Hall.Everywhere on the walls you see lighted torches. The room is dimely lit withthem. You see strange paintings on the ceiling, showing magical symbols.There is a sign on the east door.","Das Meditationszimmer.Schwarze, schimmernde Waende, eine Decke die zu den Sternen zu reichenscheint, geben diesem Raum ein mystisches Aussehen.Weiche Kissen, die ueberall am Boden verstreut herumliegen, machen einenentspannenden Eindruck. Sie scheinen den Benutzer zum ausruhen aufzufordern.In der Mitte des Raumes brennt ein gedaempftes Feuer, das den Raum nurnotduerftig erleuchtet, die Symbole, die uberall in die Wand eingelassen sindaber zu verhaltenem Gluehen anregt.","The garden in front of the house.You see different kinds of seats standing around on a well build meadow.In the middle of the meadow is a pool.This place looks nice for having partys.","The Laboratory of Bertl's.Here he is normaly for his own :)You see many strange things lying around on a big table.There is a fireplace to the east and bottle with a boiling potion standsthere. You get the feeling of good old middleage. A strange smell is inthe airOn the west wall there are many shelfs full with books and different kindsof glasses with mage-ingredients.There is a bed to the north wall, if Bertl isn't very fond of going home ;)(or maybee he is to drunk) :)To the south you see a dark window to an other dimension and anrefrigerator.","A dimly lit corridor.To the left is the kitchen","Say a dimly lit corridor.The Sleeping room is to the west.","You entered the kitchen.Its a nice room, with a large table for eating and filled up withdifferent things neede for cooking :)","The sleeping room.The only thing it contains at the moment, is a large bed.","The Bathroom of Bertl.Dont look to exactly, maybee its not cleaned up at the moment :)",})
rooms_short ({"You stand in front of Bertl's house.","The Entrance-Hall.","Das Meditationszimmer","The garden.","The Laboratory.","Dimly lit corridor.","A coridor.","The Kitchen.","Sleeping room.","Bathroom.",})
furnishings ({0,"","","","","","","","","",})
items ({({"entrance","You get a strange feeling, when you look at it. Maybee try to enter?","wall","The longer you look at it, the more you get a feeling of time and space....","garden","Looks nice, try to enter it :)","rose","Beatiful bushes of roses. The main colors are dark and dark-red.","sky","Bertl says: i hope it will not rain, i havent got a roof yet ;)","floor","You see mage-runes and pentagramms. You get a warm feeling inside.","stone","It's NOT a normal stone. I looks as if Bertl made it. But how?","chair","Looks comfortable. Sit down!","table","The table is made out of the same stone as the floor.",}),({"sign","It says \"Bertl's Meditation-Room, enter on own risc (if you can) :))",}),({"feuer","Eines von jenen magischen Feuern, mit denen sich der Hausherr zu beschaeftigen pflegt.","kissen","Schauen sehr entspannen aus, und laden den Betrachter ein sich auszuruhen.","symbole","Es ist gut, dass ihre wahre Beduetung einem Unwissenden verborgen bleibt.","decke","Ist da eine Decke, oder mit was hoert der Raum wohl auf????",}),({"pool","Looks inviting, enter it!","seat","Looks comfortable. They say: \"Sit down\"!","meadow","The grass is even so soft, you can lay down on it!",}),({"potion","You realze, that this is no potion, it is a garlic-soup (Bertl could die for)","bed","Looks very comfortable, even for two persons ;)","glas","Oh, yeah, many stuff in it, and nearly nowhere a name on it!","book","You realize, that these are no real books, there are CD-ROMs standing there.","smell","Isn't that garlic?","window","You get a cold feeling, when you try to look at it. Ask Bertl what it shows!","refrigerator","When you look at it you see it is filled up with beer \"GOESSER GOLD\" :)","table","Have you ever seen such a chaos???",}),0,0,0,({"bed","The bed smiles invitingly: Hey, wanna take a nap? ..",}),0,})
